{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1405314-review-of-hunt-for-the-red-widow","id":1405314,"title":"Review of Hunt for the Red Widow","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-30T05:14:24-07:00","id":1405314,"title":"Review of Hunt for the Red Widow","content":"Pretty good but not super fantastic. It\u2019s a lot ($4.99) for an 11 page book and I wish they had given more background on the artifact, but I liked the artifact\u2019s power and the Red Widow\u2019s character design, plus they did something unexpected with her that I thought was really cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-30T05:32:15-07:00","id":1405317,"title":"","content":"That's the virtual table top adventure, right? I think the extra cost is for the tokens, maps, etc. to be used on a virtual table top.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-30T07:04:34-07:00","id":1405324,"title":"","content":"Yes, the cost is for all the new art (maps mainly). The written content is not much in volume, but interesting. The choices are very interesting and it can fit many different stories with little to no work.<br /> <br /> In short, it is a 3 scene encounter that presume the chars are working for Aeon, but can fit any other group, even random explorers passing by. The 3 scenes can fit in one session, and the encounter it self, with an opening scene and a closing one could make a good one shot adventure for talents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-30T07:18:38-07:00","id":1405328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1405314-review-of-hunt-for-the-red-widow?p=1405324#post1405324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, the cost is for all the new art (maps mainly). The written content is not much in volume, but interesting. The choices are very interesting and it can fit many different stories with little to no work.<br /> <br /> In short, it is a 3 scene encounter that presume the chars are working for Aeon, but can fit any other group, even random explorers passing by. The 3 scenes can fit in one session, and the encounter it self, with an opening scene and a closing one could make a good one shot adventure for talents.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome \ud83d\ude0a. I totally agree with you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]}]}